    "一个隐私优先的经期、情绪与身体记录工具。为不规律 / PCOS 周期而生。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A privacy-first tracker for your period, mood, and body — built for irregular and PCOS cycles."
